  "implemented": [
    "Infer percentage requests from spanning cells in increasing span order, retaining percentages already assigned to their columns.",
    "Distribute only the remaining request among prior-zero columns by their non-spanning preferred widths, or equally when empty.",
    "Fit requests within 100% in source-column order while preserving content minima and existing width priorities.",
    "Reuse the table sizing-guess allocator for spanning percentage requests; count existing operation work and observe cancellation before span traversal and snapshot allocation."
  ],
